---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Aju House">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-16 md:py-24">
        
        <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-8">
            <a href="/" class="hover:text-black transition-colors">Home</a>
            <span>/</span>
            <span class="text-gray-900">Privacy Policy</span>
        </nav>

        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl font-medium text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold mb-12 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">Last Updated: July 2026</p>

        <div class="space-y-10 text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-light">
            
            <section class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">1. Information We Collect</h2>
                <p>When you visit <code>ajuperfumes.com</code> or complete a purchase, we collect necessary personal information to process your order. This includes:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-xs text-gray-600">
                    <li><strong>Contact Details:</strong> Full name, email address, phone number.</li>
                    <li><strong>Shipping Data:</strong> Street address, city, state, postal code.</li>
                    <li><strong>Device & Storage Data:</strong> Session state saved in browser <code>localStorage</code> to maintain shopping bag items and login authentication.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
                <p>Your information is used strictly to fulfill customer orders, send digital order confirmation invoices (via Resend), issue shipping tracking IDs via DTDC, and provide direct client support.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">3. Payment Security & Third-Party Services</h2>
                <p>We do not store or process payment card details or UPI PINs on our servers. All monetary transactions are processed securely via encrypted gateways (Razorpay) adhering to PCI-DSS standards. We share address data with our courier partners (e.g., DTDC) solely for order delivery.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">4. Cookies & Browser Storage</h2>
                <p>We use small data files and local storage mechanisms to recognize your session and save items added to your shopping bag. You can clear your browser storage at any time through your browser settings.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-gray-100">
                <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">5. Grievance Officer & Inquiries</h2>
                <p>If you wish to access, correct, or delete any personal information we hold about you, please contact our Privacy Coordinator:</p>
                <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-sm text-xs space-y-1 font-mono">
                    <p class="font-bold text-gray-900">Privacy Desk — Aju House</p>
                    <p>Email: perfumesaju@gmail.com</p>
                    <p>Phone: +91 8075304432</p>
                </div>
            </section>

        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>